    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d331">

                <pb facs="0470" n="448" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg448"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/1–2852: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the United States
                        Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Austin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1952-01-28T12:24:00-05:00">January 28,
                            1952—12:24 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p> Gadel 852. Re Membership: Request urgently answers to fol: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Does your latest estimate indicate Sov SC Res has any chance receiving
                            seven affirmative votes in SC or that Sov GA Res may obtain two-thirds
                            vote in plenary?</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>When are SC and GA plenary expected take up membership?</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
